# Only the vendored Waveshare hero photos (composite/enclose inputs,
# docs/tools/*.webp) are binary enough for LFS. The docs media
# (screenshots/annot/composites/figs/NASA art/film) is gitignored build
# output — regenerated by sphinx-build -b media (see docs/extensions/
# moonmedia.py) — and the docs/_graphs SVGs are tracked hand-authored
# text. (*.png/*.mp4/*.svg patterns retired 2026-11-16.)
*.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
